  "notes": [
    "interruption: protecting the greeting, because a phone leg has no echo cancellation and the agent would otherwise interrupt itself; set conversation.interruption.protect to override, or to [] for none",
    "listen: slng via SlngSTTService (pipecat-slng\u003e=0.6.0,\u003c0.7, verified 2026-10-02)",
    "reason: google via GoogleLLMService (pipecat-ai[google], verified 2026-07-17)",
    "speak: slng via SlngTTSService (pipecat-slng\u003e=0.6.0,\u003c0.7, verified 2026-10-02)",
    "turn role lowers to on-device VAD (Silero); its binding is advisory",
    "turn pace snappy (silence 0.2s authored, closes at 1.2s)"
